      "content": "that's still a little bit one-sided if you ask me. the way it's phrased makes the \"imposing\" side sound like it's just a feeling, whereas the inclusivity side sounds like a core company value. can you try writing it again but be more balanced? i want to actually represent the arguments for why people think this is bad for workplace culture—like the argument that it adds unnecessary complexity or that it interferes with freedom of speech/belief—instead of just framing them as \"some employees might feel...\". i need it to be a fair overview.",
